 "coverage": {
  "mode": "explicit-classified",
  "gaps": [
   "a route path, name, methods and requirements live in the arguments of #[Route]; omega-php emits reference.attribute carrying the attribute's name only, so a Handler is identified by its class and method and not by the URL it serves",
   "the template a controller renders is the first argument of $this->render(); omega-php emits call.method named render with no argument text, so SymfonyClass -> Template is unreachable",
   "a Twig reference is a logical template name (base.html.twig), not a project path, so symfony:template-name:* and symfony:template:* are two key spaces only a resolver over the Twig loader roots could join",
   "services.yaml, routes.yaml and framework.yaml are configuration this overlay does not read; only attribute-declared and interface-declared wiring is stated",
   "container compilation, autowiring resolution and runtime service decoration need runtime state no static fact carries"
  ]
 },
